{
  "logo": "https://cdn.uppromote.com/storage/uploads/logo/1764479556_8300205_b6f603ea28c4b97f03704436b1023f53.png",
  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• About our brand and products:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:graphik, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:200;letter-spacing:0.15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-line;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">We are a NYC restaurant that's been sharing our love of Japanese flavors since 2016. Now we've created Japanese-flavored snacks using the most beloved of American munchies: POPCORN! Introducing Pom Pom Popcorn. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:graphik, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:200;letter-spacing:0.15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-line;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Taking our favorite childhood treats as inspiration, we use real ingredients in everything and make our popcorn in small batches so you can taste the love, care and flavor in every bite. The result is delightful, healthier snacking. Arigato!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• What makes us different:</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:graphik, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:200;letter-spacing:0.15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-line;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Our Brand Values: Giving Back: A portion of our sales proceeds are donated to World Central Kitchen to help provide meals to those in need.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:graphik, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:200;letter-spacing:0.15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-line;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Community for All: We are a woman-, Asian-American owned small business that is proud to create a diverse and inclusive work environment for employees of all genders and backgrounds.</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:graphik, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-style:normal;font-weight:200;letter-spacing:0.15px;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;white-space:pre-line;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-color:initial;float:none;\">Small Batch: We produce all of our popcorn in-house, by hand, in small batches. We are truly a small business!!</span></p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: You earn 12% on sales</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: Please include us in your promotions! And reach out to us for collaboration ideas. We'd love to partner with you!</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• Other information: Our products are award-winning and praised by the experts! Our Furikake has received a Sofi Awards Gold Finalist Award (by the Specialty Food Association.) Our Nori Crunch Popcorn is on the 2025 NYT Holiday Gift Guide for the Frequent Traveler! We love what we do and you can tell by the quality, love, care, and FLAVOR in all of our products.</p></div></div>",
